) -> Result<Value<'gc>, Error<'gc>> {
    // It doesn't matter which clip we call this on; it simply stops any active drag.

    // We might not have had an opportunity to call `update_drag`
    // if AS did `startDrag(mc); stopDrag();` in one go,
